				<wikidot:authorName>Zyn</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1404533</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Pffft. I saw all the comments and got crazy curious, and was pleasantly still surprised at all the shenanigans even though those typically aren't my kind of thing. The format of the tale really sells the quirkiness, I feel.</p> <blockquote> <p>Sorry kids, we don't want any of your trikkertreat. Go away.<br /> (aside)<br /> What is that anyways, some kind of German thing?</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>I swear I'm gonna take a dump in your shoes, Alto.<br /> (loudly)<br /> Ok, I did it, can I go save us all from a horrible death now!?</p> </blockquote> <p>Crow is best doggo, fite me</p> <p>+1, also that cast listing with the kids' roles is brilliant</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
