				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-7870015#post-4018419</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-7870015/let-sleeping-dogs-lie-a-play-in-two-acts#post-4018419</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 09 Oct 2018 04:34:47 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Gabriel Jade</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>414239</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>No characters are allowed to acknowledge that it is in fact Halloween, but it must be blindingly obvious based on the setting.<br /> and<br /> One of the characters has to end up in a costume, against their will, to solve some issue that comes up in the tale.</p> <p>Really, this was just an excuse to use KPC and <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-244-arc">244-ARC</a> in a tale together.</p> <p><a href="https://youtu.be/NbVZPu_JM6I">Recommended background music</a></p> <p>edit: Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/newyrose" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4354260&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1539464628" alt="NewyRose" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4354260)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/newyrose" >NewyRose</a></span> for the awesome CSS theme.</p> 
				 	]]>
